{"id":"eb929b4a-8dfb-4435-9707-e97f2f4b8b0d","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:44:13.390Z","batchId":"pricing_minimax-m3-1-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .pricing-header {\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto 2rem;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .pricing-header h1 {\n    margin-bottom: .75rem;\n  }\n  .pricing-header p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .billing-toggle {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: .35rem;\n    margin-top: 1.5rem;\n    padding: .3rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    background: var(--surface);\n  }\n  .billing-toggle button {\n    border: 0;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    padding: .55rem 1rem;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    font: inherit;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .billing-toggle button.active {\n    background: var(--primary);\n    color: var(--primary-contrast);\n  }\n  .save-note {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-left: .35rem;\n    color: var(--success);\n    font-size: .75rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .pricing-grid {\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .pricing-card {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    min-width: 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .pricing-card.featured {\n    border-color: var(--primary);\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 18%, transparent);\n  }\n  .popular-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -0.8rem;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .plan-header {\n    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .plan-name {\n    margin: 0 0 .35rem;\n  }\n  .plan-description {\n    min-height: 3rem;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .plan-price {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: .35rem;\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n  }\n  .plan-price .amount {\n    font-size: 2.5rem;\n    font-weight: 750;\n    letter-spacing: -.04em;\n  }\n  .plan-price .period {\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .annual-note {\n    min-height: 1.25rem;\n    margin-top: .25rem;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    font-size: .8rem;\n  }\n  .feature-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 1.25rem 0;\n    display: grid;\n    gap: .75rem;\n  }\n  .feature-list li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: .6rem;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .feature-list li::before {\n    content: \"✓\";\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    color: var(--success);\n    font-weight: 800;\n  }\n  .pricing-card .cta {\n    margin-top: auto;\n  }\n  .pricing-note {\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    .plan-description {\n      min-height: auto;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"pricing-header\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Simple, transparent pricing</span>\n    <h1>Choose the plan that fits your workflow</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Start for free, upgrade when you need more collaboration, control, and flexibility. No setup fees.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"billing-toggle\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing period\">\n      <button type=\"button\" data-billing=\"monthly\" class=\"active\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Monthly</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" data-billing=\"annual\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Annual <span class=\"save-note\">Save 20%</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 pricing-grid\" aria-label=\"Pricing plans\">\n    <article class=\"card pricing-card\">\n      <div class=\"plan-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3 plan-name\">Free</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc plan-description\">For individuals getting started and trying out the essentials.</p>\n        <div class=\"plan-price\">\n          <span class=\"amount\" data-monthly=\"$0\" data-annual=\"$0\">$0</span>\n          <span class=\"period\">/ month</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"annual-note\" data-monthly-note=\"Free forever\" data-annual-note=\"Free forever\">Free forever</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n        <li>1 project workspace</li>\n        <li>Up to 5 team members</li>\n        <li>Unlimited tasks and documents</li>\n        <li>Core reporting</li>\n        <li>7-day activity history</li>\n        <li>Community support</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block cta\">Start for free</button>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card pricing-card featured\">\n      <span class=\"badge popular-badge\">Most popular</span>\n      <div class=\"plan-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3 plan-name\">Pro</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc plan-description\">For professionals who want advanced tools and more room to grow.</p>\n        <div class=\"plan-price\">\n          <span class=\"amount\" data-monthly=\"$18\" data-annual=\"$14\">$18</span>\n          <span class=\"period\">/ user / month</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"annual-note\" data-monthly-note=\"Billed monthly\" data-annual-note=\"$168 billed annually\">Billed monthly</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n        <li>Unlimited project workspaces</li>\n        <li>Unlimited team members</li>\n        <li>Advanced reporting and insights</li>\n        <li>Custom fields and templates</li>\n        <li>Unlimited activity history</li>\n        <li>Automations and integrations</li>\n        <li>Priority email support</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-block cta\">Start Pro trial</button>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card pricing-card\">\n      <div class=\"plan-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3 plan-name\">Team</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc plan-description\">For growing organizations that need collaboration, security, and control.</p>\n        <div class=\"plan-price\">\n          <span class=\"amount\" data-monthly=\"$36\" data-annual=\"$29\">$36</span>\n          <span class=\"period\">/ user / month</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"annual-note\" data-monthly-note=\"Billed monthly\" data-annual-note=\"$348 billed annually\">Billed monthly</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <ul class=\"feature-list\">\n        <li>Everything in Pro</li>\n        <li>Unlimited guests and collaborators</li>\n        <li>Role-based access controls</li>\n        <li>Single sign-on (SSO)</li>\n        <li>Audit logs and data exports</li>\n        <li>Shared team dashboards</li>\n        <li>Dedicated support manager</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block cta\">Contact sales</button>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted pricing-note\">All paid plans include a 14-day free trial. Prices exclude applicable taxes. You can change or cancel your plan at any time.</p>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-billing]\").forEach(function (button) {\n    button.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var period = button.getAttribute(\"data-billing\");\n      document.querySelectorAll(\"[data-billing]\").forEach(function (item) {\n        var active = item === button;\n        item.classList.toggle(\"active\", active);\n        item.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\", String(active));\n      });\n      d